MODULE: SingleSweepDemandResetsCursor
TARGET: SingleSweep
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: On-demand arrival resets a live sweep rather than preserving its cursor.
PERTURBS: Demand
--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, cursor, dirty, baseline, fingerprint, pendingBaseline,
                   repaired, probeOnly, servingDemand, sweeps, pump, busy,
                   selected, failureUsed, work>>
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: overwrite an in-progress cursor.
    /\ cursor' = 0
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, dirty, baseline, fingerprint, pendingBaseline,
                   repaired, probeOnly, servingDemand, sweeps, pump, busy,
                   selected, failureUsed, work>>
--- END
